flowchart LR
    SRC[Agent Runtime Event]
    AD[AgentAdapter Observation]
    N[Normalize canonical state]
    PI[PendingInteraction]
    AE[Immutable AttentionEvent]
    D4[D4 semantic evidence-gap detector]
    POL[D3 EffectiveAttentionPolicy]
    D1[D1 Router]
    D2[D2 Escalation Tracker]
    D5[D5 Cross-Agent Inbox]
    LOCAL[Local Desktop]
    CLOUD[Cloud Relay]
    TG[Telegram]
    IOS[iOS / APNs / Live Activity]

    SRC --> AD --> N
    N --> PI
    N --> AE
    N --> D4
    D4 -->|DERIVED only when evidence contract allows| AE
    AE --> D1
    POL --> D1
    PI --> D1
    D1 --> LOCAL
    D1 --> CLOUD
    D1 --> D2
    D1 --> D5
    D2 --> D5
    D2 --> CLOUD
    CLOUD --> TG
    CLOUD --> IOS